cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use py-idp in academic work, please cite it using the metadata
  below. The pipeline architecture (parse → classify → extract → assess
  → validate → HITL) is inspired by the AWS Solutions Library sample
  on accelerated intelligent document processing; PDF parsing wraps
  IBM Docling (arXiv:2408.09869).
